{
  "title": "Namaz on Mondays",
  "data": "On Mondays, pray 10 units; in each unit recite [Surah al-Fatihah](A5) once and [Surah al-Tawhid](A116) 10 times.",
  "merits": "Imam al-Hasan al-Askari (a.s.) is also reported to have said that whoever offers on Mondays a ten unit prayer; reciting in each unit [Surah al-Faatehah](A5) once and repeating [Surah al-Tawheed](A116) ten times, Almighty Allah will grant him on Friday light that shines the place of the Assemblage (on the Resurrection Day) due to which all the creatures of Almighty Allah will wish to have its like on that day."
}
